    "setupNotes": [
      "Official 2.1.24 Space Age. No modules: 24 electric furnaces with no modules, inserters and fast inserters, yellow belts with red underground belts, 4 substations, 2 roboports. Derived from the Autosaved \"In-Out Electric Smelter\" (autosaved-f3d991e31c13c301, https://autosaved.org/factorio/blueprints). WEST: ore in on one red belt, row 1 (second row). The station takes 900 ore per minute first; the rest leaves EAST on the same row, so copies placed 30 tiles apart chain along one ore line (one red belt feeds 2 copies). SOUTH: 900 plates per minute on one yellow belt in the last column. Iron or copper ore; a blocked plate exit or a full station never stops the ore line, and an unconnected east end does not stop the station. Supply electricity at any substation; copies placed side by side join one network.",
      "Feed iron ore or copper ore, one kind per ore line. Each was tested on its own; mixed ore on one line was not tested.",
      "Keep the splitter priorities: the entrance splitter sends ore to the station first (south output); the merge splitter sends plates to the exit column."
    ],
